@startuml
title Complaint Submission Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

actor Citizen
participant "React Web" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Auth Policy" as Auth
participant "Complaint Service" as Complaint
participant "GIS Service" as GIS
participant "AI Classifier" as AI
participant "Department Service" as Dept
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

Citizen -> Web : Submit complaint
Web -> API : POST /complaints + access token
API -> Auth : Authenticate and authorize Citizen
Auth --> API : Trusted principal
API -> Complaint : Validate and create complaint
Complaint --> API : Saved complaint + reference
API -> GIS : Save validated coordinates
API -> AI : Classify(text, active categories)
alt valid allowed recommendation
  AI --> API : Structured recommendation
  API -> Complaint : Store immutable AI result
  API -> Dept : Resolve configured category mapping
  alt active mapping exists
    Dept --> API : Department identifier
    API -> Complaint : Record final category and assignment
  else mapping missing
    Dept --> API : No active mapping
    API -> Complaint : Mark administrator review required
  end
else AI unavailable or invalid
  AI --> API : Error / invalid response / timeout
  API -> Complaint : Record failure and review requirement
end
API -> Notification : Emit complaint-created event
API --> Web : 201 Created + reference
Web --> Citizen : Confirmation
@enduml

